{
  "_comment": [
    "Example roms.json -- copy to 'roms.json' (same folder) and edit.",
    "This file pins the boot-menu name, order, and save slot of the .gb/.gbc",
    "ROMs you drop in assets/. It is optional: without it, games appear in",
    "alphabetical filename order, named after the file, with slots assigned",
    "top-down. The real roms.json is gitignored (like the ROMs); this .example",
    "is the tracked template. Underscore-prefixed keys like this one are",
    "ignored by the generator, so you can leave notes in your own file too.",
    "",
    "Each entry needs a \"file\" (must match a real file in assets/). The",
    "\"name\", \"slot\", and \"color\" fields are optional -- omit them or set",
    "them to null.",
    "  name: boot-menu label, A-Z / 0-9 / space only (lowercase is folded to",
    "        upper), max 24 chars. Defaults to the filename.",
    "  slot: flash save region 0..13. Defaults to list position. Pin it to",
    "        keep a game attached to its existing on-device save when you add,",
    "        remove, or rename ROMs. Slots must be unique.",
    "  color: hex RGB (\"#3fa9f5\" or the shorthand \"#39f\") that tints the",
    "        little label sticker on this game's cart icon in the boot menu.",
    "        Defaults to the UI accent color. Channels are shown at the",
    "        screen's 4-bit depth, so nearby shades may look identical.",
    "The array sets menu order; any assets/ files not listed here are appended",
    "alphabetically. Entries whose file is missing are skipped with a warning",
    "but keep their slot reserved (so removing/re-adding a game keeps its save)."
  ],
  "roms": [
    { "file": "polishedcrystal.gbc",  "name": "POKEMON CRYSTAL",   "slot": 0, "color": "#f5d020" },
    { "file": "chromatic_tetris.gbc", "name": "CHROMATIC TETRIS", "color": "#39f" },
    { "file": "some_other_game.gb" }
  ]
}
